1
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:07,521
Crystal-clear springs, and the cutest animals in Florida!

2
00:00:07,521 --> 00:00:10,328
Water so clear it looks like glass.

3
00:00:10,328 --> 00:00:13,776
Hundreds of manatees in the winter springs.

4
00:00:13,776 --> 00:00:15,220
And live mermaids!

5
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:21,356
This is Florida's springs road trip: about 80 miles from Silver Springs to Weeki Wachee.

6
00:00:21,356 --> 00:00:24,420
Stick around till the end for the full trip planner!

7
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:26,509
Here's the plan!

8
00:00:26,509 --> 00:00:34,840
We start at Silver Springs, then Rainbow Springs, Crystal River and Homosassa Springs, and we finish at Weeki Wachee!

9
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:38,673
We're starting at Silver Springs, near Ocala!

10
00:00:38,673 --> 00:00:42,966
Glass-bottom boats have floated over these springs since the 1870s.

11
00:00:42,966 --> 00:00:46,170
Look down, and you can see straight to the bottom!

12
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:54,160
West through Ocala's horse country, with its green pastures and white fences, all the way to Dunnellon!

13
00:00:55,110 --> 00:00:56,981
Welcome to Rainbow Springs!

14
00:00:56,981 --> 00:00:59,891
The water is so clear it looks like glass.

15
00:00:59,891 --> 00:01:05,780
Walk the gardens out to the waterfalls, or grab a kayak and paddle the Rainbow River.

16
00:01:06,730 --> 00:01:09,930
South to the coast, and into manatee country!

17
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:12,472
Welcome to Crystal River!

18
00:01:12,472 --> 00:01:16,611
Every winter, hundreds of manatees crowd into these warm springs.

19
00:01:16,611 --> 00:01:22,087
Watch from the boardwalk at Three Sisters Springs, or take a guided tour in Kings Bay.

20
00:01:22,087 --> 00:01:25,780
It's one of the few places you can legally swim with them!

21
00:01:26,730 --> 00:01:30,330
A quick hop down US 19 to Homosassa Springs!

22
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:33,176
Welcome to Homosassa Springs!

23
00:01:33,176 --> 00:01:39,647
Head down into the underwater observatory, and watch manatees and fish swim right past the windows.

24
00:01:39,647 --> 00:01:41,150
You don't even get wet!

25
00:01:42,100 --> 00:01:46,740
South on US 19, to one of the most famous roadside attractions in Florida!

26
00:01:47,690 --> 00:01:52,008
We made it to Weeki Wachee, home of the live mermaid show!

27
00:01:52,008 --> 00:01:58,709
Mermaids have performed in this spring since 1947, breathing through air hoses underwater.

28
00:01:58,709 --> 00:01:59,900
Only in Florida!

29
00:02:00,850 --> 00:02:02,380
And that's the drive!

30
00:02:02,380 --> 00:02:06,970
About 80 miles of springs, from Silver Springs to Weeki Wachee.

31
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:11,080
Here's your trip planner, everything in one place.

32
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,850
Pause and grab a screenshot!

33
00:02:16,420 --> 00:02:18,005
Thanks for riding along!

34
00:02:18,005 --> 00:02:24,477
Subscribe to Road Trip Atlas for more Florida road trips, and next time we're driving A1A from St.

35
00:02:24,477 --> 00:02:26,260
Augustine to Daytona Beach!
